In addition to the revolving[ tower] for visitors to enjoy bird[ view] of Mel[aka] city, the ticketing[ building] will also be fitted with 5 commercial outlets, which includes a[ cafe], restaurant, and[ souven]ir shops.
The admission charges for[ Menara] T[aming] Sari are[ RM]20 for an adult and[ RM]10 for children below 12 years old. There is a huge car park next to the[ tower]. For further information, please contact Mel[aka] T[aming] Sari Berhad at +60-6-2881100 or +60-6-2813366.
